	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"Orbiting a dim, dying star lies the &3Abyssal Chasm&r, a planet completely engulfed in ocean."
				""
				"Its endless waters conceal trenches so deep they fracture the planet’s crust, glowing faintly with the light of unknown organisms."
				""
				"Those who've descended (and lived to tell the tale) speak of &cruins&r possessed by the &8Deep Ones&r, an &9enigmatic ancient beast&r, and a &bsubmerged metropolis.&r"
				""
				"Beneath the weight of endless water, something stirs, waiting to be found. Or, will it find you first?"
			]
