		{
			dependencies: ["1EFED4260E8FB819"]
			description: [
				"The Pearlyte Vent is located at the bottom of the Abyssal Chasm's trenches. Find one and gaze upon the dormant vent to complete this quest. "
				""
				"You might also consider taking it home with you, or processing the Pearlyte for trading with the Deep Ones."
